        "settle down",
        "move in"
      ],
      "collocations": [
        "settle in quickly",
        "help someone settle in"
      ],
      "l1_note": "适应新环境；settle down 是安定下来或安静。",
      "collocations_zh": [
        "很快安顿下来",
        "帮某人安顿"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "put-away",
      "head": "put away",
      "base": "put",
      "particle": "away",
      "kind": "phrasal",
