      "l1_note": "中文“收拾”既可以是收好也可以是扔掉，英语要分开：put away 收好，throw away 扔掉。",
      "confusables": [
        "throw away",
        "clear out"
      ],
      "collocations": [
        "put away the groceries",
        "put your phone away"
      ],
      "collocations_zh": [
        "把买的菜收好",
        "把手机收起来"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "throw-away",
